        "tab1": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why it works",
            "text": "<p>While you sleep, your face presses and folds and your skin loses moisture, so lines set in deeper. Each patch does two things all night: it <strong>holds the skin smooth</strong> so it can't crease, and it <strong>seals in your skin's own moisture</strong>. Peel it off in the morning and your lines look ironed out.</p><p>No needles, no actives, nothing absorbed. Just soft silicone doing its job for 6–8 hours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab2": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to use",
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Prep:</strong> start with clean, fully dry skin. No serum, lotion or oil underneath.</li><li><strong>Apply:</strong> press each patch on from the center out so it lies flat. Don't stretch the skin around the eyes.</li><li><strong>Sleep:</strong> wear them overnight, 6–8 hours. Side sleeper? Press the edges once more before lights out.</li><li><strong>Morning:</strong> peel off gently, then just clean and reuse. Store each patch on its backing film.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "tab3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's in the box",
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>1 forehead patch</strong>, about 14.3 × 6 cm, with a center piece for the frown lines between your brows</li><li><strong>4 crescent patches</strong>, about 7.8 × 2.2 cm, for under-eyes, crow's feet or smile lines</li><li><strong>Backing film</strong> to store each patch between uses</li></ul><p>Choosing 2 Sets? You get two of everything.</p><p><strong>Bonus:</strong> our 8-page <em>Healthy Skin After 30</em> guide (PDF), emailed to you after you order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab4": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & returns",
            "text": "<p><strong>Free shipping</strong> on orders of $40 or more, and every Face Set option qualifies. Every order is tracked.</p><p><strong>30-day money-back guarantee:</strong> if you don't love your mornings, email support@thedailyglowco.com within 30 days of delivery for a full refund.</p>"
          }
        },
