        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will the patches stay on all night?",
            "answer": "<p>Applied to clean, fully dry skin (no serum or oil underneath), the patches are made to stay in place overnight. Smooth each one from the center outward so it sits flat, and press the edges once more if you sleep on your side.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where do the four crescents go?",
            "answer": "<p>Wherever you notice lines most: under your eyes, at the outer corners for crow's feet, or along your smile lines. Mix and match from night to night.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How many times can I reuse them?",
            "answer": "<p>Many nights with proper care. Clean each patch after use and store it on its backing film. How long they last depends on your skin prep and care routine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will they irritate my skin or cause breakouts?",
            "answer": "<p>The patches are soft silicone with no actives; nothing is absorbed into your skin. Keep them clean between uses. If your skin is sensitive, try one for an hour first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
